*2 [[Znache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
