==='''Chapter 3'''===
This level is rather easy by the time you would be completing it. Li'l Zyclone is a non-issue with any nuker and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellites]] are enough to deal with the scissoroos, easily. Bringing [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] is a good idea too.

